cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "MetaboSquad: A Multi-Agent Framework for Automated Metabolomics Research Workflows"
abstract: >-
  MetaboSquad is a graph-based conversational assistant for metabolomics. A supervisor
  routes each request to sub-agents for statistical analysis, chemical-database lookup,
  literature retrieval, figure review and direct question answering.
authors:
